# Analytics, applied by `astro build` only.
#
# Both of these are public by design: a GA4 measurement id and a PostHog project
# key are visible in the page source of any site that uses them, so they belong
# in the repo rather than in a dashboard nobody can diff. Anything genuinely
# secret would go in Cloudflare's environment variables instead.
#
# Deliberately NOT in .env, so `astro dev` never loads it and local browsing does
# not land in production analytics.
#
# The Playwright suite is a different matter: it builds in production mode, so it
# DOES load this file. playwright.config.ts blanks these three in the webServer
# environment for that reason, because an empty value in the environment wins
# over a dotenv file. Without that, every test run sent a few hundred page_view
# events to production from localhost.
PUBLIC_GA_ID=G-1S7X0WG2YT
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_KEY=phc_sx8LvUW69VfSwPoNwo8UbG2paXmsCWmVhFLmTuGHYdib
PUBLIC_POSTHOG_HOST=https://a.tenmiracle.com

# Fill in from Search Console, HTML tag method, the content value only.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_VERIFICATION=
